Package: ol-settings
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: unsoil <spliteritoob@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, libpulse0, libxi6, pkexec, polkitd, systemd, x11-xserver-utils, x11-xkb-utils, pciutils, iso-codes, xkb-data, passwd, locales
Recommends: systemd-timesyncd, pavucontrol, lxsession, lxpolkit, pcmanfm
Suggests: fonts-noto-cjk
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/omega-linux/ol-settings
Description: Settings app for OL
 A single settings window for LXDE: display, sound, appearance, mouse and
 keyboard, region and language, date and time, users and system information.
